# BrimDeck project map

Windows 11 Dynamic Island (C# / WPF / .NET 10). Solution: `BrimDeck.sln`. Fork notes: `FORK.md`.

## Projects

| Path                          | Role                                                                                                                                      |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `src/BrimDeck/`               | WPF UI, `MainWindow` / `SettingsWindow` / `App` partials, `Native/` Win32 & OS I/O                                                        |
| `src/BrimDeck.Core/`          | Domain logic, settings, usage providers, media/device models (no WPF)                                                                     |
| `src/BrimDeck.Sensors/`       | Optional elevated sensor helper (CPU/PawnIO)                                                                                              |
| `tests/BrimDeck.Tests`        | Core unit tests                                                                                                                           |
| `tests/BrimDeck.MediaTests`   | Media / player integration                                                                                                                |
| `tests/BrimDeck.WindowsTests` | Windows-hosted UI/native checks (`--hosted`)                                                                                              |
| `installer/`                  | Inno Setup (`BrimDeck.iss`)                                                                                                               |
| `scripts/`                    | Publish, local update (`Update-Local.ps1`), icons, readme media                                                                           |
| `update-local.cmd`            | Fast local deploy: publish app → swap into `%LocalAppData%\Programs\BrimDeck` → restart (`scripts/Update-Local.ps1`; `-NoStart` optional) |
| `docs/en-US/`, `docs/zh-CN/`  | Feature docs (ai-tools, music, monitor, devices, clipboard, themes, sensors)                                                              |
| `releases/`                   | Per-version release notes                                                                                                                 |

## Pages (`DeckPage` in `Core/Settings.cs`)

| Page              | UI                                  | Core / Native                                                                                 |
| ----------------- | ----------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Usage             | `UsagePanel.cs`, `ModelDetails.cs`  | `UsageService.cs`, `*Usage.cs`, `QuotaRing.cs`                                                |
| Music             | `MainWindow.Music*.cs`, `Music*.cs` | `Music.cs`, `Media*.cs`, `Native/*Media*`, `*ControlWindow.cs`                                |
| Monitor           | `Monitor*.cs`                       | `Monitor*.cs`, `CpuSensors.cs`, `Native/CpuProvider.cs`, `GpuProvider.cs`, `SystemSampler.cs` |
| Clipboard / shelf | `MainWindow.Shelf*.cs`, `Shelf*.cs` | `Shelf.cs`, `ShelfRules.cs`, `Native/ClipboardWatch.cs`                                       |
| Devices           | `Devices*.cs`, `DeviceStrip.cs`     | `Devices.cs`, `DeviceReads.cs`, `Brands/`, `Native/*Batteries.cs`, `Hid*.cs`                  |

Collapsed notch/capsule/indicator: `MainWindow.Compact*.cs`, `Core/Collapsed*.cs`, `Compact*.cs`.

## Settings UI

`SettingsWindow.cs` + `Settings*.cs` partials (Providers, Music, Monitor, Devices, Shelf, Themes, Sensors, Hotkeys, Updates, …). XAML: `SettingsResources.xaml`.

## Cross-cutting

- Themes: `PanelTheme.cs`, `Core/PanelThemes*.cs`, `Core/Themes/*.json`
- Localization: `Core/Loc.cs`
- Settings model / migrations: `Core/Settings.cs`, `SettingsMigrations.cs`, `DataLocations.cs`
- Updates: `Updates/GitHubUpdates.cs`, `Core/AppUpdates.cs`, `InstallerUpdates.cs`
- Hotkeys / tray: `App.Hotkeys.cs`, `Native/GlobalHotkeys.cs`, `TrayIcon.cs`
- Entry: `Program.cs`, `App.xaml(.cs)`

## Fork (Matti)

- Prefer new code under `src/BrimDeck/Matti/` (see that folder’s README).
- Fork MSBuild overrides: root `Directory.Build.props`; defaults in `ForkRepositoryMetadata.targets`.
- Branches: `main` = upstream mirror; work lands on `matti` (`feat/*` / `fix/*` → `matti`).

## Search tips

- Feature name → start in `Core/` for logic, matching `MainWindow.*` / `Settings*` / `Native/` for UI and OS.
- Device brand protocol → `Core/Brands/<Brand>.cs`.
- Quota provider → `Core/<Name>Usage.cs` or script provider via Settings › Quotas.
